A modern-host port of the Seventh Edition (V7) Unix PDP-11 C toolchain
(cc, cpp/c0/c1/c2, as/as2, ld) that cross-compiles PDP-11 code.

The host binaries install to ${PREFIX}/libexec/v7unix; ccv7, asv7 and ldv7
in ${PREFIX}/bin are symlinks.  The PDP-11 target runtime installs to
${PREFIX}/lib/v7unix.
